{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1000000000000001","type":"group","x":-3360,"y":-2320,"width":2060,"height":4880,"color":"4","label":"Project Reading Entry"},
		{"id":"1000000000000005","type":"group","x":2360,"y":80,"width":3560,"height":2720,"color":"2","label":"主业务链路（页面 + API + 缓存）"},
		{"id":"1000000000000002","type":"group","x":-960,"y":-2320,"width":2700,"height":2400,"color":"5","label":"Pages / Components"},
		{"id":"1000000000000006","type":"group","x":-960,"y":2960,"width":3180,"height":1400,"color":"1","label":"Nested Functions"},
		{"id":"1000000000000003","type":"group","x":2040,"y":-1640,"width":1760,"height":1520,"color":"3","label":"Component Communication + API"},
		{"id":"1000000000000007","type":"group","x":2480,"y":2960,"width":1880,"height":1120,"color":"1","label":"Questions / Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"1000000000000004","type":"group","x":-680,"y":200,"width":1620,"height":680,"color":"6","label":"补充状态说明（先不用看）"},
		{"id":"2000000000000020","type":"text","text":"## 父 -> 子 props\n\n`attendance/index.vue` 传给 `AttendanceLocationSelector`：\n\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n- `vehicleSubmitting`\n- `personalName`\n- `isTempWorker`\n\nMeaning:\n- 父页面告诉子组件当前状态。\n- 子组件不要自己猜业务状态。","x":2120,"y":-1525,"width":560,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000021","type":"text","text":"## 子 -> 父 emits\n\n`AttendanceLocationSelector` 向父页面发：\n\n- `submitVehicle`\n- `closeVehicle`\n\nMeaning:\n- 子组件只做表单校验和事件通知。\n- 接口请求、审批轮询、定位启动都在父页面。","x":3020,"y":-1525,"width":560,"height":320,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000023","type":"text","text":"## 扫码打卡 API\n\nCaller:\n- `handleScanTap(codeUrl)`\n\nMethods:\n- 临时工：`attendanceTempterm`\n- 正式员工：`attendanceLongterm`\n\nParameters:\n- `clockTime`\n- `codeUrl`\n- `lng / lat`\n\nLocation source:\n- `getClockCoordinates()` 一次性取当前位置。","x":3020,"y":-1125,"width":560,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 推荐阅读入口\n\n先按组件看，不要先陷进函数细节：\n\n1. `attendance/index.vue`：父页面，业务流程总控。\n2. `AttendanceLocationSelector.vue`：车辆表单子组件。\n3. `locationPermission.js`：扫码打卡的一次性定位权限。\n4. `account.js` + `App.vue`：登录、回前台后的恢复入口。\n5. `locationReporterRuntime.js` -> `locationReporter.js`：持续定位上报链路。","x":-3200,"y":-2190,"width":1700,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000002","type":"file","file":"travelKnowledge/我的整理/Enhance Skill 整理/location.md","x":-3200,"y":-1790,"width":1700,"height":4190,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000022","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 API\n\nCaller:\n- `attendance/index.vue`\n\nMethods:\n- `apiModifyCarStatus(vehiclePayload, true)`：创建车辆审批单。\n- `apiCheckApproval`：轮询审批状态。\n- `apiStopCar({ id })`：结束使用车辆。\n\nResponse affects:\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n- `attendanceVehicleState`","x":2100,"y":-1085,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000010","type":"text","text":"## attendance/index.vue\n\nRole:\n- 考勤首页父页面。\n- 同时管首页 UI、扫码打卡、车辆审批、车辆持续定位、本地缓存恢复。\n\nDepends on:\n- `AttendanceLocationSelector`\n- `locationPermission.js`\n- account / permission store\n- 车辆审批、打卡接口\n- location reporter runtime\n\nAffects:\n- 写 `attendanceVehicleState`\n- 启停车辆持续定位\n- 给子组件传 props，接收 emit。","x":-880,"y":-1680,"width":520,"height":540,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000012","type":"text","text":"## locationPermission.js\n\nRole:\n- 扫码打卡前的一次性定位权限 helper。\n- 只负责前台定位权限和 `uni.getLocation`。\n\nDepends on:\n- `uni.getSetting`\n- `uni.authorize`\n- `uni.openSetting`\n- `uni.getLocation`\n\nAffects:\n- 返回一次当前位置。\n- 不负责车辆持续定位，不写 runtime。","x":680,"y":-1230,"width":560,"height":470,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000024","type":"text","text":"## 轨迹上报 API\n\nCaller:\n- `locationReporter.js`\n\nMethod:\n- `reportTrack([point], false)`\n\nPayload built by:\n- `buildLocationReportPayload(location, options)`\n\nFields:\n- `entityId / type / lng / lat / trackTime / speed / direction / accuracy / altitude / clientTime`","x":2560,"y":-600,"width":560,"height":418,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000011","type":"text","text":"## AttendanceLocationSelector.vue\n\nRole:\n- 车辆使用表单和状态展示组件。\n- 不直接调接口，不直接开定位。\n\nDepends on:\n- 父页面 props：`selectedVehicle / vehicleActive / approvalStatus / submitting`。\n- 内部 `computed` 推导禁用、按钮、状态文案。\n\nAffects:\n- emit `submitVehicle`\n- emit `closeVehicle`\n- 表单校验、回显、字段联动。","x":680,"y":-2040,"width":520,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000014","type":"text","text":"## locationReporterRuntime.js\n\nRole:\n- 业务页面和底层持续定位上报器之间的桥。\n\nDepends on:\n- `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n- `createLocationReporter(...)`\n\nAffects:\n- 设置追踪对象：`entityId`\n- 设置业务类型：`type`\n- 启停上报器：`active`\n- App 回前台时判断是否直接恢复。","x":40,"y":-845,"width":520,"height":435,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000016","type":"text","text":"## App.vue\n\nRole:\n- `onShow` 时做恢复入口。\n\nOrder:\n1. 检查权限和 token。\n2. 先 `shouldResumeLocationReporter()`。\n3. runtime active 就直接 `startLocationReporter()`。\n4. 否则 `accountStore.resumeVehicleLocation()`。","x":420,"y":-270,"width":520,"height":310,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000030","type":"text","text":"## 页面内存状态\n\nOwner:\n- `attendance/index.vue`\n\nState:\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n- `vehicleSubmitting`\n- `scanLoading`\n- `vehicleApprovalRunId`\n\nLifecycle:\n- 页面显示期间有效。\n- 离开或刷新后依赖缓存恢复。","x":-560,"y":268,"width":420,"height":525,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000034","type":"text","text":"## 登录态缓存\n\nOwner:\n- `account.js`\n\nKeys:\n- `AUTHORIZATIONID`\n- `AUTHORIZATION`\n- `ACCOUNT_SOURCE`\n\nImportant:\n- 这些是登录态缓存。\n- 不要和车辆定位缓存混在一起。","x":-100,"y":268,"width":420,"height":525,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000035","type":"text","text":"## 四层状态分工\n\n1. 页面内存：负责当前展示。\n2. `attendanceVehicleState`：负责业务进度恢复。\n3. `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`：负责上报器运行恢复。\n4. reporter 底层缓存：负责上报稳定性。","x":380,"y":268,"width":420,"height":525,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000040","type":"text","text":"## 扫码流程 1\n\nUser:\n- 点击扫码区域。\n\nFunction:\n- `handleScanCodeTap()`\n\nWork:\n- 防重复扫码。\n- 调起 `uni.scanCode`。","x":2420,"y":160,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000042","type":"text","text":"## 扫码流程 3\n\nFunction:\n- `getClockCoordinates()`\n\nCalls:\n- `getCurrentLocationWithPermission()`\n- `uni.getLocation`\n\nReturns:\n- `{ lng, lat }`","x":3560,"y":160,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000032","type":"text","text":"## `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n\nRole:\n- 定位上报器运行缓存。\n\nWrite:\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId(车牌号, 1)` 写追踪对象。\n- `startLocationReporter()` 成功后写 `active = true`。\n\nRead:\n- App 回前台先读它，能直接恢复就不走业务缓存。","x":4060,"y":1245,"width":420,"height":435,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000033","type":"text","text":"## reporter 底层缓存（了解即可）\n\nOwner:\n- `locationReporter.js`\n\nKeys:\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_LAST_SUCCESS_AT`\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_PENDING_PAYLOAD`\n\nPurpose:\n- 记录成功上报时间。\n- 保存失败后待重试的定位点。","x":4060,"y":1840,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000048","type":"text","text":"## 车辆流程 5\n\nFinish:\n- 子组件 emit `closeVehicle`。\n- 父页面 `handleCloseVehicle()`。\n- 调 `apiStopCar({ id })`。\n- 停止定位。\n- 写入空车辆状态。","x":3340,"y":1295,"width":360,"height":265,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000031","type":"text","text":"## `attendanceVehicleState`\n\nRole:\n- 车辆业务缓存。\n\nWrite:\n- 提交车辆后写“审批中”。\n- 轮询时更新审批状态。\n- 结束用车后写空状态。\n\nRead:\n- 页面重新进入。\n- App 回前台兜底。\n- 正式员工重新登录。","x":4060,"y":720,"width":420,"height":450,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000047","type":"text","text":"## 车辆流程 4\n\nWhen approved:\n- `applyLocationTarget()`\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId(车牌号, 1)`\n- `startLocationReporter()`\n\nResult:\n- runtime active = true。","x":5110,"y":1240,"width":360,"height":320,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000045","type":"text","text":"## 车辆流程 2\n\nParent:\n- `handleSubmitVehicle(vehicle)`\n\nWork:\n- 组装 `vehiclePayload`。\n- 调 `apiModifyCarStatus`。\n- 写入审批中缓存。","x":3340,"y":830,"width":360,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000044","type":"text","text":"## 车辆流程 1\n\nUser:\n- 在子组件填写车辆表单。\n\nComponent:\n- `AttendanceLocationSelector`\n\nAction:\n- 校验后 emit `submitVehicle`。","x":2460,"y":830,"width":360,"height":335,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000041","type":"text","text":"## 扫码流程 2\n\nFunction:\n- `handleScanTap(codeUrl)`\n\nWork:\n- 打开 `scanLoading`。\n- 生成 `clockTime`。\n- 准备提交打卡。","x":2960,"y":160,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000043","type":"text","text":"## 扫码流程 4\n\nAPI:\n- 临时工：`attendanceTempterm`\n- 正式员工：`attendanceLongterm`\n\nResult:\n- 成功提示打卡成功。\n- finally 关闭 loading。","x":4480,"y":160,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000046","type":"text","text":"## 车辆流程 3\n\nFunction:\n- `waitVehicleApproved()`\n\nWork:\n- 最多 180 次轮询。\n- 每 10 秒查一次。\n- 每次更新审批状态和缓存。","x":5080,"y":800,"width":360,"height":290,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000050","type":"text","text":"## 恢复入口 2\n\nApp foreground:\n- `App.vue onShow`\n\nRead first:\n- `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n\nFallback:\n- 再让 store 读业务缓存。","x":2900,"y":2200,"width":360,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000051","type":"text","text":"## 恢复入口 3\n\nLogin:\n- 正式员工 `login()` 后调用 `resumeVehicleLocation()`。\n\nRead:\n- `attendanceVehicleState`\n\nNot for:\n- `loginTempWorker()`","x":3340,"y":2200,"width":360,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000049","type":"text","text":"## 恢复入口 1\n\nPage reload:\n- `onLoad`\n- `restoreVehicleState()`\n\nRead:\n- `attendanceVehicleState`\n\nNext:\n- 需要时继续 `resumeVehicleApproval()`。","x":2460,"y":2200,"width":360,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000072","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 3：缓存 key 保留\n\nEvidence:\n- `handleCloseVehicle()` 后调用 `saveVehicleState()` 写空状态。\n- `logout()` 不删除 `attendanceVehicleState`。\n\nInterpretation:\n- key 可能还在，但内容表示没有正在使用车辆。\n- 重新登录后保留业务进度可能是刻意设计。","x":2540,"y":3560,"width":560,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000071","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 2：两份恢复逻辑\n\nEvidence:\n- 页面有 `waitVehicleApproved / resumeVehicleApproval`。\n- store 里也有 `resumeVehicleApproval`。\n\nReason:\n- 页面打开时要恢复。\n- App 回前台、重新登录时也要恢复。\n\nRisk:\n- 改审批判断、轮询次数、缓存字段时，两边都要看。","x":3560,"y":3040,"width":560,"height":385,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000070","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 1：helper 是否要内联\n\nEvidence:\n- `locationPermission.js` 是 attendance 目录下的页面专属定位权限 helper。\n\nQuestion:\n- 如果后续严格贴合 `vue-inline-simplifier`，是否要合回 `attendance/index.vue`？\n\nCurrent advice:\n- 定位权限链路风险高，先不要搬业务代码。","x":2540,"y":3040,"width":560,"height":385,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000013","type":"text","text":"## store/modules/account.js\n\nRole:\n- Pinia 账号 store。\n- 负责登录、退出、账号信息和 App 级车辆定位恢复。\n\nDepends on:\n- `attendanceVehicleState`\n- runtime 方法：`setLocationReporterEntityId / startLocationReporter / stopLocationReporter`\n\nAffects:\n- 正式员工登录后尝试恢复车辆定位。\n- App 未打开 attendance 页面时，也能继续恢复审批/定位。","x":-820,"y":-555,"width":520,"height":435,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000015","type":"text","text":"## locationReporter.js\n\nRole:\n- 底层持续定位上报层。\n- attendance 不应该直接改它，除非要影响所有持续定位业务。\n\nDepends on:\n- 后台定位能力和定位监听。\n- `reportTrack([point], false)`。\n\nAffects:\n- 防重复启动。\n- 失败 payload 重试。\n- 记录上次成功上报时间。","x":1060,"y":-555,"width":560,"height":427,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000060","type":"text","text":"## 扫码打卡链\n\nCode:\n```text\nhandleScanCodeTap\n  -> handleScanTap\n    -> getClockCoordinates\n      -> getCurrentLocationWithPermission\n        -> uni.getLocation\n          -> attendanceLongterm / attendanceTempterm\n```\n\nKey idea:\n- 只取一次定位，不启动持续上报。","x":-900,"y":3135,"width":420,"height":405,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000064","type":"text","text":"## store 恢复链\n\nCode:\n```text\nlogin / App fallback\n  -> resumeVehicleLocation\n    -> read attendanceVehicleState\n    -> setLocationReporterEntityId\n    -> startLocationReporter\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- attendance 页面没打开时，也能从业务缓存恢复车辆定位。","x":-900,"y":3880,"width":500,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000066","type":"text","text":"## 权限 helper 链\n\nCode:\n```text\ngetCurrentLocationWithPermission\n  -> ensureUserLocationPermission\n    -> getAuthSetting\n    -> authorize / openSetting\n  -> uni.getLocation\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 扫码打卡前保证前台定位权限。","x":-400,"y":3480,"width":560,"height":345,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000061","type":"text","text":"## 车辆启动链\n\nCode:\n```text\nAttendanceLocationSelector\n  -> handleSubmitVehicle\n    -> apiModifyCarStatus\n      -> waitVehicleApproved\n        -> applyLocationTarget\n          -> setLocationReporterEntityId\n          -> startLocationReporter\n```\n\nKey idea:\n- 审批通过后才启动持续定位。","x":-330,"y":3025,"width":420,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000062","type":"text","text":"## waitVehicleApproved\n\nTrigger:\n- 提交车辆审批后。\n- 页面恢复未完成流程时。\n\nWork:\n- 用 `runId` 取消旧轮询。\n- 调 `apiCheckApproval`。\n- 写 `attendanceVehicleState`。\n- 通过后启动 runtime。","x":400,"y":3195,"width":420,"height":345,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000063","type":"text","text":"## 页面恢复链\n\nCode:\n```text\nonLoad\n  -> restoreVehicleState\n    -> resumeVehicleApproval\n      -> waitVehicleApproved(false)\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 页面重新进入时接着跑审批/定位后半段。","x":1200,"y":3080,"width":440,"height":345,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000067","type":"text","text":"## reporter.start\n\nWork:\n- 防重复启动。\n- 检查后台定位能力和权限。\n- 绑定定位监听。\n- 开启后台定位。\n- 补报失败 payload。\n- 主动采集一次当前位置。","x":1200,"y":3765,"width":440,"height":315,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000065","type":"text","text":"## runtime 启动链\n\nCode:\n```text\nsetLocationReporterEntityId\n  -> write LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE\nstartLocationReporter\n  -> read runtime cache\n  -> locationReporter.start\n  -> active = true\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 把业务对象和底层上报器解耦。","x":20,"y":3880,"width":590,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000073","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 4：两种定位不能混看\n\nScan:\n- 一次性取当前位置。\n- `getCurrentLocationWithPermission()`。\n- 打卡接口提交 `lng / lat`。\n\nVehicle:\n- 审批通过后持续上报。\n- `startLocationReporter()`。\n- `reportTrack` 上报轨迹。","x":3560,"y":3560,"width":560,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"3000000000000001","fromNode":"2000000000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"2000000000000002","toSide":"top","label":"source note"},
